---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
export const prerender=true;
---
<Layout title="Trailer maintenance"><section class="page-head"><div class="wrap"><div class="breadcrumbs"><a href="/">Home</a><span>/</span><span>Maintenance</span></div><p class="eyebrow">TRAILER MAINTENANCE</p><h1>Keep the trailer ready for the next load.</h1><p>Use your order reference and trailer details when requesting service support.</p></div></section><div class="wrap prose"><h2>Maintenance enquiry</h2><p>Include the trailer model, date of purchase, order reference, current location and a clear description of the work required.</p><div class="support-grid"><article class="support-card"><h2>Routine inspection</h2><p>Request checks for tyres, wheel bearings, lights, coupling, brakes and visible structural condition.</p></article><article class="support-card"><h2>Repair support</h2><p>Provide clear photographs and a description of the issue before transporting the trailer.</p></article><article class="support-card"><h2>Warranty query</h2><p>Include the purchase documents and the relevant warranty information.</p></article></div><p class="notice">Do not tow a trailer you believe is unsafe. Arrange an appropriate inspection or transport pathway first.</p><a class="button" href="/quote/">Request service support →</a></div></Layout>
